<<~ ahu slot=`#/merged-recommendation`>>

!! Merged recommendation
* T9: CUT-READY after u1. Red-first: (a) two records, distinct answers; (b) one-record control; (c) teardown isolation; (d) floor never inherits a custody door; (e) class gate by name; (f) late-stand by reference; (g) N1 refused-boot-between-1609-and-1816 leaves no cas door. Lean: explicit threading, no ambient fallback.
* T10: NEEDS-RULING, lean two kinds; stand cells after T6 pins order; verdict cells ride T11; fold N5 and the TDZ declaration move in.
* Separate lane, not a cut: N2 (stale sweep vs teardown), red-first as above; N1 can ride T9.

<<~/ahu>>

